\u00eau d\\u00f9ng\"],\"user_answer\":\"K\\u00edch th\\u00edch chi ti\\u00eau ti\\u00eau d\\u00f9ng v\\u00e0 khuy\\u1ebfn kh\\u00edch \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u01b0 kinh doanh\",\"correct_answer\":\"K\\u00edch th\\u00edch chi ti\\u00eau ti\\u00eau d\\u00f9ng v\\u00e0 khuy\\u1ebfn kh\\u00edch \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u01b0 kinh doanh\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"\\\"to stimulate consumer spending and encourage business investment\\\" n\\u00f3i r\\u00f5 m\\u1ee5c \\u0111\\u00edch k\\u00edch c\\u1ea7u ti\\u00eau d\\u00f9ng v\\u00e0 th\\u00fac \\u0111\\u1ea9y \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u01b0.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":null,\"passage_title\":null,\"audio_url\":\"https:\\/\\/assets.mixkit.co\\/active_storage\\/sfx\\/2869\\/2869-preview.mp3\",\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":null,\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":20,\"question_text\":\"[\\u0110\\u1eb7t ph\\u00f2ng] \\\"I would like to book a double room for two nights.\\\" Kh\\u00e1ch mu\\u1ed1n \\u0111\\u1eb7t ph\\u00f2ng cho m\\u1ea5y \\u0111\\u00eam?\",\"skill\":\"listening\",\"difficulty\":\"A2\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"1 \\u0111\\u00eam\",\"2 \\u0111\\u00eam\",\"3 \\u0111\\u00eam\",\"1 tu\\u1ea7n\"],\"user_answer\":\"2 \\u0111\\u00eam\",\"correct_answer\":\"2 \\u0111\\u00eam\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"\\\"for two nights\\\" ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1eb7t ph\\u00f2ng trong 2 \\u0111\\u00eam.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":null,\"passage_title\":null,\"audio_url\":\"https:\\/\\/assets.mixkit.co\\/active_storage\\/sfx\\/2869\\/2869-preview.mp3\",\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":null,\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":89,\"question_text\":\"What makes hydrothermal vent ecosystems fundamentally distinct from terrestrial biomes?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"C1\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"They derive primary metabolic energy from chemosynthesis rather than solar photosynthesis\",\"They completely lack multicellular organisms and predatory species\",\"Their water temperatures remain constantly near freezing points year-round\",\"They are immune to anthropogenic climate disruption and mineral mining\"],\"user_answer\":\"They derive primary metabolic energy from chemosynthesis rather than solar photosynthesis\",\"correct_answer\":\"They derive primary metabolic energy from chemosynthesis rather than solar photosynthesis\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"Hydrothermal communities thrive on mineral-rich fluids metabolized by chemosynthetic bacteria rather than sunlight.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"The bathypelagic abyss, once deemed a sterile wasteland, harbors extraordinarily biodiverse biomes centered around hydrothermal vents. In total darkness and under crushing hydrostatic pressure, chemosynthetic microorganisms convert dissolved hydrogen sulfide into organic sustenance, nurturing endemic tube worms and crustaceans. However, prospective seabed mining targeting polymetallic nodules threatens to obliterate these fragile benthic niches before science can document their full enzymatic potential.\",\"passage_title\":\"Abyssal Ecology and Deep-Sea Geopolitics\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":\"Ch\\u1eb7ng 3: C1 Reading\",\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":90,\"question_text\":\"According to the author, prospective seabed mining poses an acute risk because:\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"C1\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"It threatens to eradicate benthic ecosystems before their biological mechanisms are thoroughly understood\",\"It will deplete all global reserves of polymetallic nodules within five years\",\"It causes immediate tsunamis along coastal continental shelves\",\"It replaces traditional surface shipping with automated submarines\"],\"user_answer\":\"It threatens to eradicate benthic ecosystems before their biological mechanisms are thoroughly understood\",\"correct_answer\":\"It threatens to eradicate benthic ecosystems before their biological mechanisms are thoroughly understood\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"The author cautions that seabed mining threatens to obliterate these fragile niches before science can document their enzymatic potential.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"The bathypelagic abyss, once deemed a sterile wasteland, harbors extraordinarily biodiverse biomes centered around hydrothermal vents. In total darkness and under crushing hydrostatic pressure, chemosynthetic microorganisms convert dissolved hydrogen sulfide into organic sustenance, nurturing endemic tube worms and crustaceans. However, prospective seabed mining targeting polymetallic nodules threatens to obliterate these fragile benthic niches before science can document their full enzymatic potential.\",\"passage_title\":\"Abyssal Ecology and Deep-Sea Geopolitics\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":\"Ch\\u1eb7ng 3: C1 Reading\",\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":91,\"question_text\":\"The word \\\\\\\"benthic\\\\\\\" in the concluding sentence refers to:\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"C1\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"organisms living on or near the ocean floor\",\"surface-dwelling migratory pelagic birds\",\"shallow coral reef fish varieties\",\"atmosphere-filtering plankton species\"],\"user_answer\":\"organisms living on or near the ocean floor\",\"correct_answer\":\"organisms living on or near the ocean floor\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"Benthic refers to the lowest ecological zone of a body of water, including the sediment surface and sub-surface layers.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"The bathypelagic abyss, once deemed a sterile wasteland, harbors extraordinarily biodiverse biomes centered around hydrothermal vents. In total darkness and under crushing hydrostatic pressure, chemosynthetic microorganisms convert dissolved hydrogen sulfide into organic sustenance, nurturing endemic tube worms and crustaceans. However, prospective seabed mining targeting polymetallic nodules threatens to obliterate these fragile benthic niches before science can document their full enzymatic potential.\",\"passage_title\":\"Abyssal Ecology and Deep-Sea Geopolitics\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":\"Ch\\u1eb7ng 3: C1 Reading\",\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":92,\"question_text\":\"What was the historical perception of the deep bathypelagic zone prior to modern exploration?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"C1\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"It was presumed to be a barren and virtually lifeless expanse\",\"It was considered the primary nursery for pelagic tuna fisheries\",\"It was charted accurately by sixteenth-century navigators\",\"It was believed to produce most atmospheric oxygen\"],\"user_answer\":\"It was presumed to be a barren and virtually lifeless expanse\",\"correct_answer\":\"It was presumed to be a barren and virtually lifeless expanse\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"The text states the abyss was \\\\\\\"once deemed a sterile wasteland\\\\\\\" before discovery of its biodiversity.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"The bathypelagic abyss, once deemed a sterile wasteland, harbors extraordinarily biodiverse biomes centered around hydrothermal vents. In total darkness and under crushing hydrostatic pressure, chemosynthetic microorganisms convert dissolved hydrogen sulfide into organic sustenance, nurturing endemic tube worms and crustaceans. However, prospective seabed mining targeting polymetallic nodules threatens to obliterate these fragile benthic niches before science can document their full enzymatic potential.\",\"passage_title\":\"Abyssal Ecology and Deep-Sea Geopolitics\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":\"Ch\\u1eb7ng 3: C1 Reading\",\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":49,\"question_text\":\"\\u0110\\u1ecdc bi\\u1ec3n b\\u00e1o t\\u1ea1i th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n: \\\"SILENCE PLEASE - Study Area\\\". Bi\\u1ec3n b\\u00e1o n\\u00e0y y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"A1\",\"question_type\":\"reading_comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Kh\\u00f4ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0103n u\\u1ed1ng\",\"Gi\\u1eef y\\u00ean l\\u1eb7ng\",\"T\\u1eaft m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh\",\"Kh\\u00f4ng mang s\\u00e1ch ra ngo\\u00e0i\"],\"user_answer\":\"Gi\\u1eef y\\u00ean l\\u1eb7ng\",\"correct_answer\":\"Gi\\u1eef y\\u00ean l\\u1eb7ng\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"\\\"Silence please\\\" ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 xin vui l\\u00f2ng gi\\u1eef tr\\u1eadt t\\u1ef1\\/im l\\u1eb7ng.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"NOTICE:\\\\nSILENCE PLEASE\\\\nThis is a designated quiet study area. Please turn off phone ringers.\",\"passage_title\":\"Bi\\u1ec3n b\\u00e1o th\\u01b0 vi\\u1ec7n\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":null,\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":50,\"question_text\":\"\\u0110\\u1ecdc th\\u00f4ng b\\u00e1o c\\u1eeda h\\u00e0ng: \\\"OPEN Monday - Saturday: 8:00 AM - 9:00 PM. CLOSED on Sundays.\\\" C\\u1eeda h\\u00e0ng \\u0111\\u00f3ng c\\u1eeda v\\u00e0o ng\\u00e0y n\\u00e0o?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"A1\",\"question_type\":\"reading_comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Th\\u1ee9 Hai\",\"Th\\u1ee9 B\\u1ea3y\",\"Ch\\u1ee7 Nh\\u1eadt\",\"T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c ng\\u00e0y l\\u1ec5\"],\"user_answer\":\"Th\\u1ee9 B\\u1ea3y\",\"correct_answer\":\"Ch\\u1ee7 Nh\\u1eadt\",\"is_correct\":false,\"explanation\":\"\\\"CLOSED on Sundays\\\" ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00f3ng c\\u1eeda v\\u00e0o c\\u00e1c ng\\u00e0y Ch\\u1ee7 nh\\u1eadt.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"STORE HOURS:\\\\nMonday - Saturday: 8:00 AM - 9:00 PM\\\\nSunday: CLOSED\",\"passage_title\":\"Gi\\u1edd m\\u1edf c\\u1eeda\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":null,\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":51,\"question_text\":\"\\u0110\\u1ecdc email n\\u1ed9i b\\u1ed9: \\\"Dear Staff, our annual company picnic is scheduled for Saturday, October 15th at Green Lake Park. Transportation will be provided from the office at 7:30 AM.\\\" Xe \\u0111\\u01b0a \\u0111\\u00f3n nh\\u00e2n vi\\u00ean kh\\u1edfi h\\u00e0nh l\\u00fac m\\u1ea5y gi\\u1edd?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"A2\",\"question_type\":\"reading_comprehension\",\"options\":[\"6:30 AM\",\"7:00 AM\",\"7:30 AM\",\"8:00 AM\"],\"user_answer\":\"7:30 AM\",\"correct_answer\":\"7:30 AM\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"\\u0110o\\u1ea1n v\\u0103n n\\u00eau r\\u00f5: \\\"Transportation will be provided from the office at 7:30 AM\\\".\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"Dear Staff,\\\\nOur annual company picnic is scheduled for Saturday, October 15th at Green Lake Park. Free lunch and sports activities will be available for everyone. Transportation will be provided from the office at 7:30 AM.\",\"passage_title\":\"Company Picnic Announcement\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":null,\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":52,\"question_text\":\"\\u0110\\u1ecdc t\\u1edd r\\u01a1i kh\\u00f3a h\\u1ecdc: \\\"English for Travel: Learn essential phrases for airports, hotels, and restaurants. 4 weeks, 2 sessions per week. Special 20% discount for early bird registration before May 1st.\\\" \\u01afu \\u0111\\u00e3i n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c d\\u00e0nh cho ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd s\\u1edbm tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ng\\u00e0y 1 th\\u00e1ng 5?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"A2\",\"question_type\":\"reading_comprehension\",\"options\":[\"T\\u1eb7ng s\\u00e1ch gi\\u00e1o tr\\u00ecnh mi\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed\",\"Gi\\u1ea3m 20% h\\u1ecdc ph\\u00ed\",\"H\\u1ecdc th\\u1eed mi\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed 1 tu\\u1ea7n\",\"\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u1ecdc k\\u00e8m 1-1\"],\"user_answer\":\"Gi\\u1ea3m 20% h\\u1ecdc ph\\u00ed\",\"correct_answer\":\"Gi\\u1ea3m 20% h\\u1ecdc ph\\u00ed\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"T\\u1edd r\\u01a1i ghi: \\\"Special 20% discount for early bird registration before May 1st\\\".\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"English for Travel Course:\\\\nMaster real-world conversations at international airports, hotels, and dining.\\\\nDuration: 4 weeks (8 classes).\\\\nEarly bird bonus: 20% discount if registered before May 1st.\",\"passage_title\":\"Travel Course Flyer\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":null,\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":53,\"question_text\":\"Theo \\u0111o\\u1ea1n v\\u0103n, xu h\\u01b0\\u1edbng l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c t\\u1eeb xa (remote work) mang l\\u1ea1i l\\u1ee3i \\u00edch m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt n\\u00e0o?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"B1\",\"question_type\":\"reading_comprehension\",\"options\":[\"T\\u0103ng s\\u1ea3n l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng ti\\u00eau th\\u1ee5 \\u0111i\\u1ec7n\",\"Gi\\u1ea3m thi\\u1ec3u kh\\u00ed th\\u1ea3i c\\u00e1c-bon do gi\\u1ea3m ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ti\\u1ec7n \\u0111i l\\u1ea1i h\\u00e0ng ng\\u00e0y\",\"T\\u0103ng di\\u1ec7n t\\u00edch v\\u0103n ph\\u00f2ng cho thu\\u00ea\",\"Th\\u00fac \\u0111\\u1ea9y s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ed3 nh\\u1ef1a d\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n\"],\"user_answer\":\"Gi\\u1ea3m thi\\u1ec3u kh\\u00ed th\\u1ea3i c\\u00e1c-bon do gi\\u1ea3m ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ti\\u1ec7n \\u0111i l\\u1ea1i h\\u00e0ng ng\\u00e0y\",\"correct_answer\":\"Gi\\u1ea3m thi\\u1ec3u kh\\u00ed th\\u1ea3i c\\u00e1c-bon do gi\\u1ea3m ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ti\\u1ec7n \\u0111i l\\u1ea1i h\\u00e0ng ng\\u00e0y\",\"is_correct\":true,\"explanation\":\"B\\u00e0i vi\\u1ebft nh\\u1ea5n m\\u1ea1nh: \\\"reducing daily commutes has led to a measurable decline in carbon emissions and urban traffic congestion\\\".\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"In recent years, the shift toward telecommuting has dramatically reshaped the corporate landscape. Beyond enhancing work-life balance and flexibility for employees, reducing daily commutes has led to a measurable decline in carbon emissions and urban traffic congestion. Studies indicate that companies adopting hybrid models also consume significantly less office electricity and paper.\",\"passage_title\":\"Environmental Impacts of Remote Work\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":null,\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":54,\"question_text\":\"Theo \\u0111o\\u1ea1n v\\u0103n, nguy\\u00ean nh\\u00e2n ch\\u00ednh khi\\u1ebfn lo\\u00e0i ong m\\u1eadt suy gi\\u1ea3m qu\\u1ea7n th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 g\\u00ec?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"B1\",\"question_type\":\"reading_comprehension\",\"options\":[\"Thi\\u1ebfu ngu\\u1ed3n n\\u01b0\\u1edbc s\\u1ea1ch\",\"S\\u1ef1 k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p gi\\u1eefa m\\u1ea5t m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng s\\u1ed1ng, thu\\u1ed1c tr\\u1eeb s\\u00e2u v\\u00e0 bi\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u1ed5i kh\\u00ed h\\u1eadu\",\"S\\u1ef1 gia t\\u0103ng c\\u1ee7a c\\u00e1c lo\\u00e0i chim \\u0103n th\\u1ecbt\",\"Nhi\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u1ed9 m\\u00f9a \\u0111\\u00f4ng qu\\u00e1 l\\u1ea1nh\"],\"user_answer\":\"Nhi\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u1ed9 m\\u00f9a \\u0111\\u00f4ng qu\\u00e1 l\\u1ea1nh\",\"correct_answer\":\"S\\u1ef1 k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p gi\\u1eefa m\\u1ea5t m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng s\\u1ed1ng, thu\\u1ed1c tr\\u1eeb s\\u00e2u v\\u00e0 bi\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u1ed5i kh\\u00ed h\\u1eadu\",\"is_correct\":false,\"explanation\":\"B\\u00e0i vi\\u1ebft n\\u00eau: \\\"a combination of habitat fragmentation, widespread pesticide use, and shifting climatic patterns\\\".\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"Honeybees play a pivotal role in maintaining agricultural biodiversity by pollinating roughly one-third of the global food supply. However, apiaries worldwide are reporting unprecedented colony collapses. Ecologists point to a combination of habitat fragmentation, widespread pesticide use, and shifting climatic patterns as the primary drivers threatening their survival.\",\"passage_title\":\"Global Pollinator Crisis\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":null,\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":81,\"question_text\":\"What is the primary objective of deploying IoT sensors in smart urban transit systems?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"B2\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"To optimize real-time traffic flow and diminish transit congestion\",\"To replace human drivers across all public bus routes immediately\",\"To restrict citizen movements during peak commercial hours\",\"To increase municipal parking fees throughout downtown districts\"],\"user_answer\":\"To increase municipal parking fees throughout downtown districts\",\"correct_answer\":\"To optimize real-time traffic flow and diminish transit congestion\",\"is_correct\":false,\"explanation\":\"The passage notes that IoT sensors monitor congestion dynamically to optimize signal timings and reduce transit gridlock.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"Smart cities utilize an extensive matrix of Internet of Things (IoT) sensors, cloud computing, and real-time data analytics to overhaul municipal infrastructure. Within transportation networks, smart traffic lights respond dynamically to vehicle density, effectively trimming commuter delays and urban emissions. Furthermore, predictive maintenance systems monitor bridge integrity and water pipelines, averting costly catastrophic structural failures before they materialize.\",\"passage_title\":\"Smart Cities: The IoT Urban Revolution\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":\"Ch\\u1eb7ng 2: B2 Reading\",\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":82,\"question_text\":\"According to the passage, how do predictive maintenance systems enhance city infrastructure?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"B2\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"By identifying potential structural defects prior to severe failures\",\"By constructing additional bridges without architectural permits\",\"By privatizing public water utility management networks\",\"By automating tax collection procedures for civil construction\"],\"user_answer\":\"By privatizing public water utility management networks\",\"correct_answer\":\"By identifying potential structural defects prior to severe failures\",\"is_correct\":false,\"explanation\":\"The text highlights that predictive maintenance monitors integrity to avert catastrophic failures before they happen.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"Smart cities utilize an extensive matrix of Internet of Things (IoT) sensors, cloud computing, and real-time data analytics to overhaul municipal infrastructure. Within transportation networks, smart traffic lights respond dynamically to vehicle density, effectively trimming commuter delays and urban emissions. Furthermore, predictive maintenance systems monitor bridge integrity and water pipelines, averting costly catastrophic structural failures before they materialize.\",\"passage_title\":\"Smart Cities: The IoT Urban Revolution\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":\"Ch\\u1eb7ng 2: B2 Reading\",\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":83,\"question_text\":\"The word \\\\\\\"overhaul\\\\\\\" in the first sentence is closest in meaning to:\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"B2\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"thoroughly renovate and modernize\",\"slowly demolish and abandon\",\"strictly limit the usage of\",\"temporarily relocate outside\"],\"user_answer\":\"strictly limit the usage of\",\"correct_answer\":\"thoroughly renovate and modernize\",\"is_correct\":false,\"explanation\":\"To overhaul means to examine, repair, and comprehensively upgrade or renovate an existing system.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"Smart cities utilize an extensive matrix of Internet of Things (IoT) sensors, cloud computing, and real-time data analytics to overhaul municipal infrastructure. Within transportation networks, smart traffic lights respond dynamically to vehicle density, effectively trimming commuter delays and urban emissions. Furthermore, predictive maintenance systems monitor bridge integrity and water pipelines, averting costly catastrophic structural failures before they materialize.\",\"passage_title\":\"Smart Cities: The IoT Urban Revolution\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":\"Ch\\u1eb7ng 2: B2 Reading\",\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null},{\"question_id\":84,\"question_text\":\"Which environmental dividend directly stems from smart traffic management?\",\"skill\":\"reading\",\"difficulty\":\"B2\",\"question_type\":\"mcq\",\"options\":[\"Reduction of vehicle exhaust emissions\",\"Immediate elimination of urban noise pollution\",\"Complete conversion of all vehicles to solar electricity\",\"Expansion of downtown residential parks\"],\"user_answer\":\"Immediate elimination of urban noise pollution\",\"correct_answer\":\"Reduction of vehicle exhaust emissions\",\"is_correct\":false,\"explanation\":\"The passage states smart traffic lights trim commuter delays and urban emissions.\",\"feedback_note\":null,\"passage\":\"Smart cities utilize an extensive matrix of Internet of Things (IoT) sensors, cloud computing, and real-time data analytics to overhaul municipal infrastructure. Within transportation networks, smart traffic lights respond dynamically to vehicle density, effectively trimming commuter delays and urban emissions. Furthermore, predictive maintenance systems monitor bridge integrity and water pipelines, averting costly catastrophic structural failures before they materialize.\",\"passage_title\":\"Smart Cities: The IoT Urban Revolution\",\"audio_url\":null,\"min_words\":null,\"task_type\":null,\"testlet_index\":null,\"testlet_badge\":\"Ch\\u1eb7ng 2: B2 Reading\",\"testlet_info\":null,\"testlet_question_num\":null,\"testlet_size\":null}]', 26, 17, 170, 'active', NULL, '2026-09-07 09:14:09', '2026-09-07 09:19:31');

