(131, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', 'A workshop memo on Job Interview & Workplace Communication announces: \'The hands-on session is limited to 20 attendees on a first-come, first-served basis.\' How will participants be admitted to the session? [Set 3]', '[\"In the order of their registration until full\",\"By random lottery selection only\",\"Based on seniority in the organization\",\"Only candidates with doctoral degrees\"]', NULL, 'In the order of their registration until full', '\'First-come, first-served\' mang ý nghĩa ai đăng ký trước sẽ được ưu tiên trước cho đến khi đủ số lượng.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
