(133, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', 'Select the most cohesive transition word: \'The team encountered unexpected obstacles in Job Interview & Workplace Communication. ___, they delivered the project ahead of schedule.\' Which transition word best expresses contrast? [Set 3]', '[\"Nevertheless\",\"Furthermore\",\"Consequently\",\"Similarly\"]', NULL, 'Nevertheless', '\'Nevertheless\' (Tuy nhiên / Mặc dù vậy) thể hiện sự tương phản rõ nét giữa khó khăn ban đầu và kết quả thành công.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
(134, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', 'Which of the following sentences regarding Job Interview & Workplace Communication demonstrates the most concise and formal writing style? Choose the most professional sentence: [Set 3]', '[\"The department evaluated three proposals before reaching a final decision.\",\"The department kind of looked at three things and then made up its mind.\",\"We did a whole bunch of thinking about stuff and decided eventually.\",\"Lots of people thought about things and then decided what to do next.\"]', NULL, 'The department evaluated three proposals before reaching a final decision.', 'Câu thứ nhất sử dụng từ vựng chuẩn xác (\'evaluated\', \'proposals\', \'reaching a final decision\') và cấu trúc trang trọng.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
(135, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', 'In an evaluation of \'Job Interview & Workplace Communication\', what does the phrase \'benchmark against global standards\' mean? Explain the meaning of \'benchmark against global standards\': [Set 3]', '[\"Compare performance against established international criteria\",\"Ignore all international regulations\",\"Set lower expectations for domestic teams\",\"Copy competitors without verification\"]', NULL, 'Compare performance against established international criteria', '\'Benchmark against\' có nghĩa là đối chiếu, so sánh hiệu suất với chuẩn mực đã được công nhận trên toàn cầu.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
(136, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', 'According to the latest industry review on \'Job Interview & Workplace Communication\', organizations that adopt modern practices experience a significant boost in productivity. What is the observed outcome of adopting modern practices in \'Job Interview & Workplace Communication\'? [Set 4]', '[\"Substantial enhancement in overall productivity\",\"An immediate increase in operational errors\",\"A decrease in team collaboration\",\"Complete stagnation in development\"]', NULL, 'Substantial enhancement in overall productivity', '\'Significant boost in productivity\' đồng nghĩa với \'Substantial enhancement in overall productivity\'.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
(137, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', '[AUDIO] Speaker: \'When preparing for a comprehensive assessment in Job Interview & Workplace Communication, time management is just as crucial as subject knowledge.\' According to the speaker, what factor is equally important as subject knowledge? [Set 4]', '[\"Effective management of time\",\"Having advanced computer software\",\"Finishing questions in under ten minutes\",\"Memorizing definitions without understanding\"]', NULL, 'Effective management of time', '\'Time management is just as crucial\' khẳng định quản lý thời gian quan trọng tương đương kiến thức chuyên môn.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
(138, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', 'Choose the most appropriate collocation: \'The executive committee agreed to ___ rigorous standards for Job Interview & Workplace Communication.\' Which verb best completes the collocation? [Set 4]', '[\"implement\",\"refuse\",\"evaporate\",\"disguise\"]', NULL, 'implement', '\'Implement rigorous standards\' (áp dụng/triển khai các tiêu chuẩn nghiêm ngặt) là cụm từ chuyên môn chuẩn xác.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
(139, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', 'In an academic debate regarding \'Job Interview & Workplace Communication\', an interlocutor states: \'There is compelling evidence that collaboration yields superior outcomes.\' What does \'compelling evidence\' imply? [Set 4]', '[\"Strong and convincing proof\",\"Doubtful and unverified claims\",\"Confusing experimental results\",\"Irrelevant background trivia\"]', NULL, 'Strong and convincing proof', '\'Compelling evidence\' nghĩa là bằng chứng thuyết phục, rõ ràng và có căn cứ vững chắc.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
(140, NULL, 'reading', 'A1', 1, NULL, 'mcq', 'Identify the error in the following statement about Job Interview & Workplace Communication: \'Despite of the strict guidelines, many candidates managed to finish on time.\' Which part of the sentence contains a grammatical error? [Set 4]', '[\"\'Despite of\' (should be \'Despite\' or \'In spite of\')\",\"\'the strict guidelines\'\",\"\'managed to finish\'\",\"\'on time\'\"]', NULL, '\'Despite of\' (should be \'Despite\' or \'In spite of\')', '\'Despite\' không đi với giới từ \'of\'. Cần dùng \'Despite + N\' hoặc \'In spite of + N\'.', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:47:47', '2026-09-07 17:05:42', '2026-09-07 17:05:42'),
